{"ticker":"TMUS","updated":"2026-10-30T23:17:16Z","profile":{"longName":"T-Mobile US, Inc.","shortName":"T-Mobile US, Inc.","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.t-mobile.com","fullTimeEmployees":75000,"marketCap":165712609280,"trailingPE":15.085825,"forwardPE":10.914117,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.7663577,"pegRatio":0.53,"targetMeanPrice":226.96,"targetHighPrice":296.0,"targetLowPrice":165.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":25,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.074,"earningsGrowth":0.336,"grossMargins":0.62979,"operatingMargins":0.24746001,"profitMargins":0.120459996,"totalRevenue":93815996416,"beta":0.317,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":224.75,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":143.75,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.18},"summary":"T-Mobile US, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides wireless communications services in the United States, Puerto Rico, and the United States Virgin Islands. The company offers voice, messaging, and data services to postpaid, prepaid, and wholesale and other services customers. It also provides wireless devices, including smartphones, wearables, tablets, home broadband gateways, headsets, and other mobile communication devices, as well as accessories; financing through equipment installment plans; reinsurance for device insurance policies and extended warranty contracts. The company offers services under the T-Mobile, Metro by T-Mobile, and Mint Mobile brands through its owned and operated retail stores, customer care channels, national retailers, and its websites, as well as through T-Mobile, Metro by T-Mobile, and Mint Mobile apps. It also sells devices to dealers and other third-party distributors for resale through independent third-party retail outlets and various third-party websites. It has 700 MHz wireless spectrum licenses. The company was founded in 1994 and is headquartered in Bellevue, Washington. T-Mobile US, Inc. operates as a subsidiary of Deutsche Telekom AG.","summary_zh":"T-Mobile US, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、波多黎各和美屬維京群島提供無線通訊服務。該公司向後付費、預付費、批發和其他服務客戶提供語音、訊息和數據服務。它還提供無線設備，包括智慧型手機、穿戴式裝置、平板電腦、家庭寬頻網關、耳機和其他行動通訊設備以及配件；透過設備分期付款計劃融資；設備保險單和延長保固合約的再保險。該公司透過其擁有和經營的零售店、客戶服務管道、全國零售商及其網站，以及透過 T-Mobile、Metro by T-Mobile 和 Mint Mobile 應用程序，以 T-Mobile、Metro by T-Mobile 和 Mint Mobile 品牌提供服務。它還向經銷商和其他第三方分銷商銷售設備，然後透過獨立的第三方零售店和各種第三方網站進行轉售。它擁有700 MHz無線頻譜許可證。該公司成立於 1994 年，總部位於華盛頓州貝爾維尤。 T-Mobile US, Inc. 以 Deutsche Telekom AG 的子公司營運。","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"電信服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":251.7,"h":258.66,"l":251.2,"c":255.89,"v":4055600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":253.31,"h":254.41,"l":251.32,"c":252.66,"v":3822900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":254.21,"h":256.69,"l":250.75,"c":252.12,"v":3349100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":252.83,"h":255.74,"l":251.61,"c":252.76,"v":3294200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":241.13,"h":247.25,"l":237.4,"c":242.9,"v":6313600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":242.53,"h":243.72,"l":240.84,"c":242.72,"v":3651800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":241.89,"h":242.9,"l":238.5,"c":240.38,"v":4942000},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":240.24,"h":242.34,"l":239.52,"c":241.39,"v":4321900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":240.09,"h":242.82,"l":239.68,"c":241.72,"v":3085700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":241.39,"h":244.24,"l":238.42,"c":239.74,"v":3062500},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":239.88,"h":240.15,"l":236.15,"c":237.62,"v":3639600},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":238.9,"h":240.82,"l":238.33,"c":239.45,"v":3422300},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":237.53,"h":240.74,"l":237.21,"c":238.83,"v":3545100},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":238.83,"h":239.79,"l":236.44,"c":238.17,"v":7442100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":237.03,"h":240.32,"l":235.11,"c":237.44,"v":4686900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":236.6,"h":240.78,"l":234.76,"c":239.49,"v":4668000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":238.19,"h":242.37,"l":236.99,"c":238.4,"v":3683400},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":240.17,"h":242.31,"l":237.24,"c":237.94,"v":3824400},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":238.99,"h":240.26,"l":236.64,"c":237.47,"v":2543300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":237.46,"h":239.82,"l"